== Trivia ==
* War appeared in the original ''The Binding of Isaac.''
* War is one of the [[wikipedia:Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse|Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse]] mentioned in the Bible.
* In many depictions of War, he is shown [[wikipedia:Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse#Red Horse|holding a sword vertically]], corresponding with why War's battle sprite shows him holding his hobby-horse vertically.
* Although his appearance on the vs screen shows his hobby-horse as brown, it is red in-game.
* War's "horse" appears more akin to a bull.
* In the original game, War's face was round.
** {{dlc|r}} This has been somewhat reverted.
* War can be seen wielding a {{i|Wire Coat Hanger}} as a weapon [https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Ctelz4lVIAAOkrT?format=jpg&name=4096x4096 in one of the original game's concept arts].
* When holding {{i|Mars}}, Isaac strongly resembles {{E|War}}, referencing the Roman god of war, [[wikipedia:Mars (mythology)|Mars]].

